WEBVTT

00:00:01.310 --> 00:00:04.100
Morning!

00:00:04.100 --> 00:00:04.810
Morning!

00:00:04.810 --> 00:00:07.480
So... are you getting used to school?

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:08.900
Not at all.

00:00:08.900 --> 00:00:10.990
Something new happens every day,

00:00:10.990 --> 00:00:13.740
and I haven't had time to adjust to anything!

00:00:13.740 --> 00:00:16.120
Karasuma... senpai.

00:00:17.160 --> 00:00:18.410
Good luck!

00:00:18.410 --> 00:00:19.490
Go for it!

00:00:30.610 --> 00:00:35.910
It doesn't matter when

00:00:30.610 --> 00:00:35.910
itsudemo donna toki mo

00:00:36.010 --> 00:00:41.340
I always think of your smile

00:00:36.010 --> 00:00:41.340
omoidasu no wa kimi no egao de

00:00:41.470 --> 00:00:46.810
The single word that I couldn't say

00:00:41.470 --> 00:00:46.810
mada sono tada hitokoto

00:00:46.850 --> 00:00:52.010
I've always wanted to say it to you

00:00:46.850 --> 00:00:52.010
kimi ni mo tsutae dainda zutto

00:00:51.780 --> 00:00:55.490
I pray so that our hearts may be connected

00:00:51.780 --> 00:00:55.490
ima wa fureoi inotteta

00:00:55.350 --> 00:00:58.230
But I couldn't see through the clouds

00:00:55.350 --> 00:00:58.230
kumo wo tsuuka mienai

00:00:58.070 --> 00:01:02.980
In front of you, I swear that

00:00:58.070 --> 00:01:02.980
mae ni chikatta toshitemo

00:01:02.830 --> 00:01:05.840
I will always be your side

00:01:02.830 --> 00:01:05.840
koko ni iru yo

00:01:05.550 --> 00:01:12.720
The future we anticipate is still far away

00:01:05.550 --> 00:01:12.720
bokura no mezasu mirai wa mada mada tooku

00:01:12.680 --> 00:01:16.280
You say that it's at the end of the world

00:01:12.680 --> 00:01:16.280
hateshi naitteto

00:01:16.300 --> 00:01:21.950
As long as I have a reason to shed tears

00:01:16.300 --> 00:01:21.950
namida no sonowake ga aru kagiri

00:01:21.800 --> 00:01:26.810
I will not stop moving towards it

00:01:21.800 --> 00:01:26.810
massugu aruite yukou

00:01:26.610 --> 00:01:36.740
As usual, we'll be together today

00:01:26.610 --> 00:01:32.840
bokutachi wa nani mo kawarazu ni

00:01:32.690 --> 00:01:36.740
kyou mo tonari ni iru

00:01:38.190 --> 00:01:42.190
In the same world

00:01:38.190 --> 00:01:42.190
onaji kono sekai ni ite

00:01:52.190 --> 00:01:57.930
The Fifth Longsword

00:01:53.630 --> 00:01:57.930
Let's Go On a Date!

00:02:00.050 --> 00:02:01.430
You are...?

00:02:03.470 --> 00:02:07.440
Senpai, please read this.

00:02:09.060 --> 00:02:10.810
What should I do?

00:02:10.810 --> 00:02:12.270
You really gave it to him!

00:02:14.190 --> 00:02:15.400
Wow!

00:02:15.400 --> 00:02:17.450
That was Hinagata-san from the first year class!

00:02:17.450 --> 00:02:19.320
Hinagata-dono?

00:02:19.320 --> 00:02:21.200
Is she famous?

00:02:21.200 --> 00:02:22.830
Yeah, she's famous!

00:02:22.830 --> 00:02:27.830
She's a girl who's drawn attention as a rival of Ikaruga-san in the next Miss Yokko!

00:02:27.830 --> 00:02:29.420
Unbelievable!

00:02:29.420 --> 00:02:30.540
A rival of Ibuki-dono?

00:02:31.040 --> 00:02:31.960
Damn it!

00:02:31.960 --> 00:02:35.170
Why do you bless him with such great fortune, God?!

00:02:35.880 --> 00:02:41.050
What an honor as a swordsman to receive a challenge from such a person!

00:02:41.050 --> 00:02:42.550
What?

00:02:43.010 --> 00:02:46.470
I really love you so very, very, very much!

00:02:46.470 --> 00:02:47.180
Love.

00:02:47.180 --> 00:02:50.810
If you could, would you go on a date with Hina next Sunday?

00:02:50.810 --> 00:02:54.360
I will be waiting at Asamigawa Station at 10.

00:02:54.360 --> 00:02:56.280
From, Hinagata Yui.

00:02:56.280 --> 00:02:57.780
It's what I thought it'd be.

00:02:57.780 --> 00:03:00.240
She's asking you out on a date.

00:03:01.030 --> 00:03:02.820
A date?

00:03:02.820 --> 00:03:07.750
Due to my inexperience, I've never heard of such a duel.

00:03:07.750 --> 00:03:09.870
A date isn't a duel!

00:03:10.920 --> 00:03:12.000
It isn't?

00:03:13.500 --> 00:03:14.880
A date is...

00:03:14.880 --> 00:03:15.380
...well...

00:03:15.960 --> 00:03:18.970
...it allows a couple to strengthen their bond...

00:03:21.180 --> 00:03:22.470
Read this!

00:03:26.310 --> 00:03:27.640
I see.

00:03:29.980 --> 00:03:33.190
So a date is about a boy and a girl spending intimate time together!

00:03:34.770 --> 00:03:38.280
A date with such a cute girl...

00:03:38.280 --> 00:03:41.700
I-I-I don't know what to do.

00:03:42.950 --> 00:03:44.570
You're horrible!

00:03:45.450 --> 00:03:47.240
How so?

00:03:47.240 --> 00:03:48.870
I was only asking for advice.

00:03:50.290 --> 00:03:52.500
You two are so hot!

00:03:52.500 --> 00:03:54.130
Why does he get all the chicks?!

00:03:54.130 --> 00:03:55.380
Jesus!

00:03:57.880 --> 00:03:59.210
Geez!

00:03:59.210 --> 00:04:01.920
I can't believe Yoichi-san's attitude.

00:04:01.920 --> 00:04:03.800
You're losing it, Ibuki.

00:04:03.800 --> 00:04:06.760
I can't believe he calls himself a swordsman!

00:04:06.760 --> 00:04:08.470
He's all over that girl... how pathetic!

00:04:08.470 --> 00:04:11.560
Do whatever you want, then!

00:04:12.520 --> 00:04:16.020
It was my first time and I didn't know what to do, so it just happened.

00:04:16.020 --> 00:04:18.070
You'd better take responsibility!

00:04:18.070 --> 00:04:19.570
Wh-Wh-What responsibility?

00:04:25.570 --> 00:04:26.570
Yoichi-san!

00:04:32.250 --> 00:04:33.920
Go on a date with me!

00:04:35.960 --> 00:04:37.710
Ibuki, you're so bold!

00:04:37.710 --> 00:04:39.960
Karasuma, why only you?

00:04:39.960 --> 00:04:41.710
Oh my God!

00:04:41.710 --> 00:04:43.880
That's not what I meant!

00:04:45.380 --> 00:04:50.180
The way you are now, I can't even imagine how you'd act.

00:04:50.180 --> 00:04:53.810
I can't risk a scar on the proud name of Ukiha Kamikaze style,

00:04:53.810 --> 00:04:57.270
so you'll go on a practice date with me!

00:04:57.690 --> 00:04:59.230
Ibuki-dono?

00:04:59.230 --> 00:05:00.650
Ibuki-chan...

00:05:00.650 --> 00:05:02.280
Ikaruga-san...

00:05:08.370 --> 00:05:09.660
Hmm, what should I do?

00:05:09.660 --> 00:05:11.290
Which clothes should I wear?

00:05:13.370 --> 00:05:14.290
Maybe these?

00:05:14.910 --> 00:05:17.630
Perhaps these are better?

00:05:17.630 --> 00:05:18.790
Maybe they're too casual.

00:05:18.790 --> 00:05:22.170
Hey, what am I so nervous about?

00:05:22.170 --> 00:05:24.340
This is just a practice date.

00:05:24.340 --> 00:05:26.340
And I'm just going with Yoichi-san.

00:05:26.340 --> 00:05:28.140
Impressive.

00:05:28.140 --> 00:05:30.850
A great model makes any clothing look good.

00:05:31.220 --> 00:05:33.930
Chihaya, Kagome.

00:05:33.930 --> 00:05:34.680
You were home?

00:05:34.680 --> 00:05:35.940
Yo.

00:05:35.940 --> 00:05:37.400
Knock, knock.

00:05:37.400 --> 00:05:39.900
Ibuki-oneechan, are you going out?

00:05:39.900 --> 00:05:42.400
N-Not really.

00:05:43.530 --> 00:05:45.530
Just gonna go shopping!

00:05:50.030 --> 00:05:52.080
Ibuki-oneechan?

00:05:56.330 --> 00:05:59.540
The view here is as grand as always.

00:06:00.210 --> 00:06:02.550
It reminds me of the day I came down from the mountain.

00:06:03.000 --> 00:06:04.210
That's right...

00:06:04.210 --> 00:06:08.550
...I haven't really shown him around since he got here.

00:06:09.550 --> 00:06:12.930
Yoichi-san, do you have somewhere you-

00:06:12.310 --> 00:06:16.270
I go by the name of Karasuma Yoichi of the Ukiha Kamikaze style!

00:06:16.270 --> 00:06:18.100
He has a wooden sword.

00:06:17.270 --> 00:06:21.270
As a man in training, I shall take on any challenge you present!

00:06:21.270 --> 00:06:23.770
If you think yourself strong, then come-

00:06:24.280 --> 00:06:26.030
I'm sorry!

00:06:26.030 --> 00:06:28.030
He's caused you so much trouble!

00:06:33.240 --> 00:06:34.540
Ibuki-dono...

00:06:35.490 --> 00:06:38.580
These clothes are tight and hard to move in.

00:06:38.580 --> 00:06:40.750
And I can't get my spirit up, either.

00:06:40.750 --> 00:06:42.130
You can't take it off!

00:06:42.130 --> 00:06:45.380
It's 'cause you're always in those clothes with a sword that you start what you did back there.

00:06:47.630 --> 00:06:49.260
And look.

00:06:50.800 --> 00:06:52.260
You don't look half bad.

00:06:54.310 --> 00:06:55.430
Something wrong?

00:06:55.430 --> 00:06:56.520
No.

00:06:56.520 --> 00:06:58.640
They sure are large.

00:06:58.640 --> 00:07:00.650
Hey, look over here, Yoichi-san!

00:07:01.060 --> 00:07:03.150
These are so cute!

00:07:03.150 --> 00:07:06.190
They're a bit of a fad these days.

00:07:06.190 --> 00:07:08.490
It's so cute.

00:07:10.110 --> 00:07:12.530
I like this color, too.

00:07:12.530 --> 00:07:14.620
Which one do you like, Yoichi-san?

00:07:15.080 --> 00:07:16.870
This is unexpected.

00:07:16.870 --> 00:07:19.330
I didn't know you were into this kind of stuff.

00:07:23.540 --> 00:07:24.750
Well...

00:07:24.750 --> 00:07:27.050
Shall we go somewhere else?

00:07:27.420 --> 00:07:29.840
What am I doing?

00:07:29.840 --> 00:07:33.050
Does he think I'm childish now?

00:07:38.520 --> 00:07:40.640
Tada!

00:07:40.640 --> 00:07:41.810
How do I look?

00:07:41.810 --> 00:07:43.310
Looks pretty good.

00:07:43.310 --> 00:07:44.610
You look great.

00:07:44.610 --> 00:07:47.150
You have thin legs, Ayame-chan.

00:07:47.150 --> 00:07:49.240
I'm so jealous that you look great in skirts.

00:07:49.240 --> 00:07:50.610
Really?

00:07:50.610 --> 00:07:53.240
If only your chest was big.

00:07:54.120 --> 00:07:56.240
Yeah, mine are really small!

00:07:56.240 --> 00:07:58.200
I'm just kidding!

00:07:58.200 --> 00:08:00.330
Please forgive me, Ayame-chan!

00:08:00.330 --> 00:08:01.040
Huh?

00:08:01.040 --> 00:08:03.080
Isn't that your sister?

00:08:07.460 --> 00:08:09.670
I just remembered I have to do something.

00:08:09.670 --> 00:08:10.460
Hey!

00:08:10.460 --> 00:08:11.880
Don't you have to pay?

00:08:17.680 --> 00:08:19.060
Yay!

00:08:20.350 --> 00:08:21.520
That was impressive.

00:08:21.520 --> 00:08:25.310
This is a game where you compete by knocking down the most pins.

00:08:25.310 --> 00:08:26.770
Simple, right?

00:08:28.360 --> 00:08:30.030
I understand completely.

00:08:30.320 --> 00:08:30.990
Now...

00:08:35.950 --> 00:08:38.780
It's harder than I thought.

00:08:38.780 --> 00:08:41.160
What are you throwing it for?!

00:08:41.540 --> 00:08:42.710
Listen carefully.

00:08:42.710 --> 00:08:46.080
You don't throw the ball, you roll the ball.

00:08:46.630 --> 00:08:48.790
You put your fingers in here and hold it up.

00:08:48.790 --> 00:08:51.670
Then you look at those triangle marks on the floor...

00:08:57.180 --> 00:08:58.180
I'm sorry.

00:08:58.180 --> 00:08:59.220
I got too close.

00:08:59.220 --> 00:09:00.770
My apologies as well.

00:09:01.520 --> 00:09:02.220
Oww!

00:09:02.930 --> 00:09:04.230
Are you okay?

00:09:11.530 --> 00:09:14.240
Where are you looking?!

00:09:14.240 --> 00:09:15.110
Hey!

00:09:15.110 --> 00:09:16.570
Stop doing that!

00:09:16.570 --> 00:09:18.320
You're disturbing the other customers!

00:09:18.320 --> 00:09:19.990
Right, I'm sorry.

00:09:19.990 --> 00:09:21.950
You make holes in the wall and create a ruckus.

00:09:21.950 --> 00:09:24.330
If you do anything else, I'm kicking you out!

00:09:22.660 --> 00:09:24.250
It's just like I thought.

00:09:24.330 --> 00:09:26.920
That's my sister and Samurai.

00:09:26.920 --> 00:09:29.630
Why are you always like that, Yoichi-san?

00:09:27.580 --> 00:09:30.340
I couldn't quite tell because he wasn't wearing his usual clothes.

00:09:29.630 --> 00:09:31.000
Are you feeling guilty?

00:09:31.000 --> 00:09:34.970
They're shopping and bowling together.

00:09:34.970 --> 00:09:36.010
They're...

00:09:36.010 --> 00:09:38.510
...clearly on a date.

00:09:38.510 --> 00:09:40.140
You two!

00:09:40.140 --> 00:09:41.220
Why are you here?

00:09:41.600 --> 00:09:43.350
Investigating, my dear sister.

00:09:43.350 --> 00:09:44.680
Getting some manga materials.

00:09:44.680 --> 00:09:46.350
What about you?

00:09:46.350 --> 00:09:49.690
I-I'm just here to bowl by myself.

00:09:49.690 --> 00:09:54.490
Anyway, when did those two get so close?

00:09:56.320 --> 00:09:58.320
Don't worry!

00:10:02.450 --> 00:10:03.330
Huh?

00:10:03.330 --> 00:10:04.790
Are you leaving?

00:10:04.790 --> 00:10:05.830
Yeah.

00:10:05.830 --> 00:10:08.120
Oh, are you feeling jealous?

00:10:08.120 --> 00:10:09.920
That's not it.

00:10:11.090 --> 00:10:13.460
I just think we shouldn't interrupt them.

00:10:17.420 --> 00:10:20.850
Well, I'm just investigating.

00:10:23.180 --> 00:10:24.890
Is something wrong?

00:10:24.890 --> 00:10:27.020
I sensed someone watching us.

00:10:27.730 --> 00:10:29.020
Was it my imagination?

00:10:29.810 --> 00:10:33.110
Are people watching us because he's so bad?

00:10:35.150 --> 00:10:37.110
All right, let's practice.

00:10:37.530 --> 00:10:40.700
Let's try to get at least one pin down.

00:10:40.700 --> 00:10:41.620
Okay?

00:10:43.700 --> 00:10:44.830
Okay.

00:10:45.540 --> 00:10:49.170
Use your elbow like this and roll it straight in front of you.

00:10:49.170 --> 00:10:50.080
Okay?

00:10:50.080 --> 00:10:51.330
Now try it again.

00:10:56.670 --> 00:10:59.010
What does this mean?

00:11:12.310 --> 00:11:13.730
It's me.

00:11:13.730 --> 00:11:15.980
What's going on with those two?

00:11:17.320 --> 00:11:18.360
Listen to me.

00:11:18.360 --> 00:11:20.070
Break up their relationship now!

00:11:20.450 --> 00:11:22.490
And kill Karasuma!

00:11:23.780 --> 00:11:26.290
You're so useless.

00:11:32.370 --> 00:11:34.290
Hey, Wassan, look.

00:11:34.790 --> 00:11:37.800
That's Ikaruga's second eldest.

00:11:38.420 --> 00:11:39.510
Second eldest?

00:11:39.510 --> 00:11:41.130
Ikaruga-san's sister?

00:11:41.130 --> 00:11:42.130
Yeah.

00:11:42.130 --> 00:11:47.930
The second eldest is a straight-A student, good at sports, is pretty, and is also popular.

00:11:47.930 --> 00:11:52.310
But she's a little touchy and doesn't really stand out.

00:11:53.350 --> 00:11:55.480
Ikaruga-san's sister?

00:11:55.480 --> 00:11:58.320
Then she'd eventually be my...

00:11:59.320 --> 00:12:02.110
She's your sister-in-law now, dear.

00:12:02.110 --> 00:12:05.570
Nice to meet you, brother.

00:12:10.540 --> 00:12:11.960
Hey, Torigaya!

00:12:11.960 --> 00:12:13.580
You shouldn't say stuff like that.

00:12:17.800 --> 00:12:19.460
They shouldn't be compared.

00:12:19.460 --> 00:12:21.760
What, Wassan, are you standing up for her?

00:12:21.760 --> 00:12:22.720
That's not it.

00:12:23.220 --> 00:12:24.300
Really?

00:12:24.300 --> 00:12:26.760
You say some decent stuff sometimes.

00:12:27.390 --> 00:12:28.680
It's not her fault.

00:12:28.680 --> 00:12:32.600
Ikaruga-san is a woman of amazing abilities.

00:12:33.100 --> 00:12:35.520
And sometimes you make me sick.

00:12:35.520 --> 00:12:37.400
By the way, Torigaya.

00:12:37.400 --> 00:12:40.320
Have you shrunk lately?

00:12:40.320 --> 00:12:41.440
How can I?

00:12:42.820 --> 00:12:44.530
Who knows.

00:13:01.510 --> 00:13:04.220
Tsubasa-chan looked like she was doing fine.

00:13:04.220 --> 00:13:07.180
I hope they do well in reviving their school.

00:13:10.100 --> 00:13:11.890
He speaks a little oddly,

00:13:11.890 --> 00:13:14.560
but seeing him like this, he looks like a normal high schooler.

00:13:25.070 --> 00:13:27.660
Oh yeah, Ibuki-dono.

00:13:27.660 --> 00:13:28.780
Hmm?

00:13:28.780 --> 00:13:29.990
Is something wrong?

00:13:30.910 --> 00:13:32.830
Oh, nothi-

00:13:35.660 --> 00:13:36.790
Ibuki-dono!

00:13:54.350 --> 00:13:55.430
Yoichi-san...

00:13:55.430 --> 00:13:57.190
Uh, I'm sorry.

00:13:57.190 --> 00:13:59.770
I tried to help you...

00:14:06.820 --> 00:14:11.450
But... I'm always like this around you, aren't I?

00:14:13.740 --> 00:14:17.660
I'm known as an honor student at school,

00:14:17.660 --> 00:14:21.040
but when I'm with you, I can't seem to be that way.

00:14:21.040 --> 00:14:22.340
Ibuki-dono.

00:14:22.960 --> 00:14:24.090
Back there...

00:14:25.300 --> 00:14:28.430
...I was trying to give this to you.

00:14:28.430 --> 00:14:30.430
That's the...

00:14:30.430 --> 00:14:31.350
Yes.

00:14:31.350 --> 00:14:35.470
You were admiring it, so I bought it for you.

00:14:41.150 --> 00:14:42.650
Thank you, Yoichi-san.

00:14:43.520 --> 00:14:44.820
I'm so happy.

00:14:44.820 --> 00:14:46.360
I'll cherish it.

00:14:46.860 --> 00:14:49.280
She must really love the doll.

00:14:51.030 --> 00:14:51.990
Ibuki-dono.

00:14:53.490 --> 00:14:56.120
I thank you for today.

00:14:56.120 --> 00:14:58.710
Thank you for practicing with me.

00:15:01.880 --> 00:15:05.380
Now I feel like I'm ready for the real thing.

00:15:05.380 --> 00:15:07.380
The doll is a token of my thanks.

00:15:08.170 --> 00:15:11.050
Right... practice.

00:15:12.850 --> 00:15:16.810
I'm gonna go get something warm to drink!

00:15:17.270 --> 00:15:18.350
Hmm.

00:15:18.350 --> 00:15:20.850
What did he mean by practice?

00:15:23.060 --> 00:15:24.310
Karasuma-senpai!

00:15:25.110 --> 00:15:27.110
What happened to you?

00:15:27.690 --> 00:15:29.530
Why, if it isn't Hinagata-dono.

00:15:30.280 --> 00:15:33.490
I fell into the fountain.

00:15:33.490 --> 00:15:35.830
I still have much to train in.

00:15:37.080 --> 00:15:38.950
Oh, that's right.

00:15:38.950 --> 00:15:43.080
I had something to tell you, Hinagata-dono.

00:15:43.920 --> 00:15:46.590
The... reply to my letter?

00:15:47.460 --> 00:15:53.800
Firstly, Hinagata-dono, I thank you for asking me out on a date.

00:15:53.800 --> 00:15:55.640
I was quite happy.

00:15:55.640 --> 00:15:59.100
Because you're so strong and wonderful...

00:15:59.100 --> 00:16:00.850
But my apologies.

00:16:00.850 --> 00:16:02.560
I will decline your offer this time.

00:16:05.520 --> 00:16:06.570
Why?

00:16:06.940 --> 00:16:11.530
I don't know much about you, Hinagata-dono.

00:16:11.530 --> 00:16:12.610
And...

00:16:13.700 --> 00:16:14.660
And?

00:16:14.660 --> 00:16:20.040
I believe a date should be between two people who love each other.

00:16:23.000 --> 00:16:24.040
I see.

00:16:25.380 --> 00:16:30.210
I was going to eat you away slowly once I had gotten to know you,

00:16:30.210 --> 00:16:32.220
but I'm not gonna be so indirect anymore!

00:16:33.340 --> 00:16:35.180
When you...

00:16:36.680 --> 00:16:38.180
...lost your sword...

00:16:38.180 --> 00:16:39.850
...you lost...

00:16:39.850 --> 00:16:42.350
...the battle!

00:16:42.350 --> 00:16:44.520
A martial high school girl?!

00:16:45.270 --> 00:16:48.270
Prepare yourself, Karasuma-senpai!

00:16:48.270 --> 00:16:50.280
Who are you?!

00:16:50.280 --> 00:16:51.780
I'm sorry.

00:16:51.780 --> 00:16:53.610
This is business.

00:16:54.240 --> 00:16:57.820
You swing your weapon for such a reason?!

00:16:57.820 --> 00:16:58.830
No.

00:16:59.660 --> 00:17:00.330
I'm so scared.

00:17:08.040 --> 00:17:09.750
You sure are tough.

00:17:10.130 --> 00:17:11.670
Then how about this?

00:17:12.260 --> 00:17:14.550
Saginomiya Souten Style Polearm Technique:

00:17:16.300 --> 00:17:18.510
Serpent Strike!

00:17:18.510 --> 00:17:19.510
Yoichi-san!

00:17:19.510 --> 00:17:20.510
Oniichan!

00:17:24.100 --> 00:17:26.020
I've been watching you.

00:17:26.020 --> 00:17:31.150
Why is such a cutie together with such a tasteless guy?

00:17:31.150 --> 00:17:33.280
I think you're missing out on a lot.

00:17:33.690 --> 00:17:37.780
Ditch him and come play with us.

00:17:38.280 --> 00:17:41.290
Throw this kiddie toy away, too.

00:17:47.750 --> 00:17:53.800
Yeah, he's lewd, tasteless, and pathetic.

00:17:55.300 --> 00:17:59.930
But I got excited all on my own.

00:18:06.270 --> 00:18:07.520
He stopped it with his hands?

00:18:12.770 --> 00:18:14.610
It's a little hard to use, but...

00:18:14.610 --> 00:18:17.610
Ukiha Kamikaze Style, Fourth Technique: Arashi!

00:18:24.790 --> 00:18:27.500
How much do you think these uniforms cost?

00:18:27.500 --> 00:18:29.330
That was so, so mean!

00:18:30.130 --> 00:18:31.290
I'm sorry.

00:18:31.650 --> 00:18:32.880
Gosh, you suck!

00:18:32.880 --> 00:18:34.630
I hate you!

00:18:34.630 --> 00:18:36.760
I can't believe you!

00:18:40.340 --> 00:18:42.430
Chihaya-dono, Kagome-dono.

00:18:43.890 --> 00:18:47.640
Why, Yoichi-tsan, I was just investigating, and...

00:18:47.640 --> 00:18:49.100
It's fine.

00:18:49.100 --> 00:18:51.270
I knew you two were following us.

00:18:51.270 --> 00:18:52.440
Please, let me go!

00:18:52.900 --> 00:18:53.860
That voice...

00:18:53.860 --> 00:18:55.030
Ibuki-nee!

00:18:55.650 --> 00:18:56.990
Ibuki-dono!

00:18:56.990 --> 00:18:58.530
Oneechan!

00:19:00.360 --> 00:19:02.950
Oh, it's Chihaya and Kagome.

00:19:02.950 --> 00:19:03.910
Why are you here?

00:19:05.830 --> 00:19:07.000
Ibuki-dono?

00:19:07.000 --> 00:19:08.710
What happened to them...

00:19:08.710 --> 00:19:11.880
They tried to hit on me, so I taught them a lesson.

00:19:11.880 --> 00:19:13.420
Did I overdo it?

00:19:14.800 --> 00:19:17.050
That is just like you.

00:19:17.050 --> 00:19:19.300
Just like me?

00:19:20.540 --> 00:19:22.890
Not in a bad way!

00:19:22.890 --> 00:19:24.470
You're right.

00:19:27.670 --> 00:19:29.690
Well, it's getting dark.

00:19:29.690 --> 00:19:32.100
Let's go home and get dinner.

00:19:44.570 --> 00:19:45.240
What?

00:19:45.240 --> 00:19:46.450
You failed?

00:19:46.450 --> 00:19:48.040
He tore apart my uniform!

00:19:48.040 --> 00:19:49.910
I can't believe that guy.

00:19:49.910 --> 00:19:51.620
But it's all covered, right?

00:19:51.620 --> 00:19:54.080
I don't pay money for failure.

00:19:54.080 --> 00:19:56.040
Wh-What?!

00:19:56.040 --> 00:20:01.220
I bought bags, sandals, and like, thirty outfits, and they're all charged on credit!

00:20:01.220 --> 00:20:03.840
I also want a really cute swim suit!

00:20:03.840 --> 00:20:05.220
Shut up!

00:20:06.890 --> 00:20:11.100
Every single one of them is useless.

00:20:11.100 --> 00:20:12.890
I guess I will have to go.

00:20:13.520 --> 00:20:17.860
You seem to be troubled with your repeated failures, brother.

00:20:19.320 --> 00:20:23.410
Perhaps it's time to call on my strength?

00:20:27.910 --> 00:20:29.080
What?

00:20:29.080 --> 00:20:30.790
They were on a practice date?

00:20:31.250 --> 00:20:32.910
Apparently.

00:20:32.910 --> 00:20:34.750
O-Oh...

00:20:34.750 --> 00:20:37.170
Then those two weren't really...

00:20:37.170 --> 00:20:38.460
Wait a minute.

00:20:38.460 --> 00:20:41.170
If it was a practice, then there's a real one, right?!

00:20:41.170 --> 00:20:42.340
Who's he going to date?!

00:20:42.340 --> 00:20:43.630
Who?!

00:20:43.090 --> 00:20:46.390
She sure is entertaining to watch.

00:20:43.630 --> 00:20:44.550
Really, who?!

00:20:44.550 --> 00:20:46.390
This isn't over yet!

00:20:46.390 --> 00:20:48.810
Well, that is...

00:20:50.640 --> 00:20:51.850
Ibuki-dono.

00:20:52.890 --> 00:20:54.350
Yoichi-san.

00:20:54.350 --> 00:20:57.020
Today was quite enjoyable.

00:20:57.020 --> 00:20:59.820
I'm sure your real date will be even more fun.

00:21:01.530 --> 00:21:02.940
About that...

00:21:06.280 --> 00:21:07.950
You declined?

00:21:07.950 --> 00:21:09.160
Yes.

00:21:09.160 --> 00:21:14.330
After going on a date for the first time, I realized something.

00:21:14.330 --> 00:21:18.250
A date should be between two people who love each other.

00:21:21.670 --> 00:21:25.550
I also do not understand Hinagata's feelings.

00:21:25.550 --> 00:21:29.390
Then I guess your real date will be postponed for a while.

00:21:29.390 --> 00:21:32.180
It appears so.

00:21:32.180 --> 00:21:37.150
Perhaps it's something that a swordsman like myself will never see happen.

00:21:37.150 --> 00:21:38.980
That's not-

00:21:42.860 --> 00:21:46.400
Yeah, you're so lewd and tasteless and pathetic!

00:21:46.400 --> 00:21:48.530
Ibuki-dono?

00:21:47.530 --> 00:21:48.530
But!

00:21:49.410 --> 00:21:52.410
Even then, someone will like-

00:21:57.080 --> 00:21:58.710
Nevermind.

00:22:20.820 --> 00:22:27.320
I regret not realizing

00:22:20.820 --> 00:22:27.320
taisetsuna hito datte wakarazu ni

00:22:28.270 --> 00:22:34.890
That you were the most important person to me

00:22:28.270 --> 00:22:34.890
sugoshiteta imamade ga kuyashiiyo

00:22:35.870 --> 00:22:42.450
I have to deliver these feelings to you myself

00:22:35.870 --> 00:22:42.450
jibun kara iwanakucha dame nanda

00:22:43.480 --> 00:22:51.910
Please, stay by my side forever

00:22:43.480 --> 00:22:51.910
itsumademo itsumademo koko ni ite kienaide

00:22:51.510 --> 00:22:56.140
The same feelings that were born through a dream

00:22:51.510 --> 00:22:56.140
yume unda onaji kimochi daitara

00:22:55.940 --> 00:22:59.900
Make me hesitate a little

00:22:55.940 --> 00:22:59.900
sukoshi mayoi kanji tetahazu

00:22:59.770 --> 00:23:06.890
When I open my heart and free myself from sadness

00:22:59.770 --> 00:23:06.970
kokoro hirake kanashimi toki hanatsu shunkan wa

00:23:06.770 --> 00:23:10.760
I will seize tomorrow with both of my hands

00:23:06.770 --> 00:23:10.760
ashita wo tsukamaeru ryoute

00:23:10.660 --> 00:23:14.610
I hope you will light up the dawn in my heart

00:23:10.660 --> 00:23:14.610
tomoshitai to negau yoake

00:23:14.650 --> 00:23:16.960
You're not alone

00:23:14.650 --> 00:23:16.960
hitori ja nai

00:23:16.760 --> 00:23:21.290
Because I love you

00:23:16.760 --> 00:23:21.290
masaka LOVE YOU

00:23:21.730 --> 00:23:25.900
I know you're afraid of change

00:23:21.730 --> 00:23:25.900
kawaruno ga kowai to kimi mo

00:23:25.740 --> 00:23:29.320
So I promise to stay by your side, smiling

00:23:25.740 --> 00:23:29.320
kitto soba ni hohoemu kara

00:23:29.320 --> 00:23:36.920
Let's change kindness into strength

00:23:29.320 --> 00:23:36.920
yasashisa de tsuyoku narouyo

00:23:40.060 --> 00:23:42.060
Next Episode!

00:23:40.690 --> 00:23:41.650
Hi.

00:23:41.650 --> 00:23:43.310
I am Yoichi's Father.

00:23:42.060 --> 00:24:07.130
Sixth Longsword

00:23:42.060 --> 00:24:07.130
Wassan Appears!

00:23:43.310 --> 00:23:46.360
My son Yoichi's friend is Wassan.

00:23:46.360 --> 00:23:47.400
Oh, no, no, no.

00:23:47.400 --> 00:23:48.440
Not croissant.

00:23:48.440 --> 00:23:49.570
Okay?

00:23:49.570 --> 00:23:52.320
Wassan is man in the man.

00:23:52.320 --> 00:23:55.530
He's much a man and sentimental guy.

00:23:56.620 --> 00:24:01.040
He fights my son by harakiri fight.

00:24:01.920 --> 00:24:06.000
In next episode, who are winner?

00:24:07.090 --> 00:24:08.920
Have a nice day!

00:24:07.090 --> 00:24:10.090
Don't miss the next episode!
